    "body": "The reason isn't a strong one, but since `code` is a legacy feature not used by new exception types (including recently-introduced `DOMException` names like `\"EncodingError\"` or `\"NotAllowedError\"`), I didn't want to carry it over to any `DOMException`-derived interfaces.",
